  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children in Conflict: Food Security and Livelihoods and Education in North Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated food security and livelihoods (FSL) and education project in the North of Yemen, in the Al-Makhadir district, Ibb Governorate, with funding for the project coming from both Children in Conflict, and an individual donor. The project will increase the resilience
of conflict-affected children (IDP and host households) in Ibb through increased food security and access to safe and sustainable education and will run for 10 months, from January &#x2013; October 2023. I</narrative>
